    <string name="about_application_title">Uhlelo lokusebenza</string>
    <string name="about_description">I-Svitlo uhlelo lokusebenza lokubuka amashejuli okucisha kukagesi e-Ukraine. Londoloza ikhaya, indawo yokusebenza nezinye izindawo ezibalulekile ukuze ubone ishejuli yanamuhla nekasasa futhi uhlele usuku lwakho.</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_title">Isebenza kanjani</string>
    <string name="about_how_it_works_body">Engeza indawo: khetha isifunda, umhlinzeki kagesi neqembu lokucisha. Setha igama lakho nesithonjana. Esikrinini esikhulu kuzovela ishejuli enezikhawu zengxenye yehora, uphawu lwesikhathi samanje nesikhathi sokubuyekezwa kwedatha. Wonke amashejuli abonisa isikhathi saseKyiv.</string>
    <string name="about_reminders_title">Izikhumbuzo</string>
    <string name="about_reminders_body">Endaweni ngayinye ungakhetha ukuthi isikhumbuzo sithunyelwe amaminithi amangaki ngaphambi kokucisha. Imodi ethi “Ungangihlupheli ebusuku” ivala izikhumbuzo kusuka ku-23:00 kuya ku-07:00. Vumela izaziso ezilungiselelweni ze-Android. Isikhathi sokulethwa sincike ezimvumeni zesistimu nasemikhawulweni yedivayisi.</string>
    <string name="about_widget_title">Iwijethi nokufinyelela ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi</string>
    <string name="about_widget_body">Engeza iwijethi esikrinini sasekhaya ukuze ubuke ishejuli ngaphandle kokuvula uhlelo futhi ushintshe phakathi kwanamuhla nekusasa. Amashejuli adawunilodiwe agcinwa kudivayisi futhi atholakala ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi. Ukuthola idatha entsha kudinga uxhumo lwenethiwekhi.</string>
    <string name="about_sources_title">Imithombo yedatha</string>
    <string name="about_sources_body">Uhlelo lulanda amashejuli ashicilelwe e-YASNO API nakumagcinakusasa avulekile edatha yokucisha kukagesi. Ishejuli yakusasa ivela ngemva kokushicilelwa umthombo. Ukuvuselelwa kwedatha kuncike emithonjeni; idatha egciniwe ingase ibe byatha. Ngesikhathi sokucisha kwesimo esiphuthumayo, ukunikezwa kukagesi kwangempela kungahluka eshejulini.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Ubumfihlo</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">Izindawo ezigciniwe nezilungiselelo zigcinwa kudivayisi ngokwayo. Uhlelo lusebenzisa i-Firebase ukuhlaziya ukusetshenziswa, imibiko yokuphahlazeka nezaziso zesevisi. Amagama ezindawo ezigciniwe awengezwa emicimbini yokuhlaziya nasemibikweni yokuphahlazeka.</string>
